\u2014each with its own story and visual identity.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372950/extras/7492b364baf19999073e55de322ff8cc.poster.avif?t=1749801418\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372950/extras/7492b364baf19999073e55de322ff8cc.webm?t=1749801418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372950/extras/7492b364baf19999073e55de322ff8cc.mp4?t=1749801418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde0 Character &amp; World Progression</strong>: Upgrade your skill tree, uncover hidden data logs, and piece together the mystery of Embla\u2019s origin.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfb5 Atmospheric Sound &amp; Story</strong>: Dive into a rich narrative with stylized visuals and an emotional soundtrack inspired by Norse sagas and futuristic ruins.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372950/extras/bd29294905ee336cb3ba182a06d20353.poster.avif?t=1749801418\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372950/extras/bd29294905ee336cb3ba182a06d20353.webm?t=1749801418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372950/extras/bd29294905ee336cb3ba182a06d20353.mp4?t=1749801418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
